request.description:
Response format:
```json
{
  "jsonapi": {"version": "1.1"},
  "data": {
    "type": "fields",
    "id": "uuid",
    "attributes": {
      "name": "Main Farm",
      "latitude": 0.3476
    },
    "links": {
      "self": "/fields/uuid"
    }
  }
}
```

Response includes relationship to field:
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "crops",
    "id": "uuid",
    "attributes": {...},
    "relationships": {
      "field": {
        "data": {"type": "fields", "id": "field-uuid"}
      }
    }
  }
}
```

